WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Read rules before promising an offer
Review type, priority, schedule, conditions and rewards. Lower priority
numbers run first; the promotion type must be recognized by the pricing
rules.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check published content separately
Read title, slug, publication state and date. Saving a draft does not
make a page visible to customers.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Check the period statement
Check statement period, currency, net amount and status. Gross sales,
commission deductions and paid net are not interchangeable figures.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Follow the issue and its history
Read subject, priority, state and replies together. A resolved support
ticket is not proof of a payment, refund or shipment action.

